    "# TASK 2: Multi-Agent Retrieval and Collaborative Search\n",
    "## Marks: 2\n",
    "\n",
    "### Objective\n",
    "Design a collaborative retrieval architecture using specialized agents with different roles and expertise.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Components:\n",
    "1. Specialized Retrieval Agents\n",
    "2. Agent Collaboration Strategy\n",
    "3. Conflict Resolution\n",
    "4. Evidence Unification"
   ]
