    "# TASK 5: System Evaluation, Explainability, and Production Deployment\n",
    "## Marks: 2\n",
    "\n",
    "### Objective\n",
    "Design comprehensive evaluation framework for the multi-agent RAG system.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Components:\n",
    "1. Retrieval Evaluation Metrics\n",
    "2. Generation Evaluation Metrics\n",
    "3. Robustness Testing\n",
    "4. Production Monitoring"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
